epoch-4.CurrentGuessReasoning:
All accepted strings contain at least one c. After the first c the rest of the word is highly restricted:
- if the next symbol is c the word is only c’s (at least two of them);
- if the next symbol is a the word may end, or may have a second c followed only by a‑/b‑only suffix (no further c);
- if the next symbol is b the suffix may be empty, a block of only b’s, or a single b followed by one or more a’s.  
Leading a’s may appear before the first c, but a lone c is not allowed.

